message: "If you use Speccanopy in research, please cite it as below."
title: "Speccanopy: an AI-assisted software architecture design engine"
type: software
version: 0.8.0
abstract: >-
  Research prototype that turns software requirements into a rooted component tree
  plus a typed interaction graph with traceable requirements, risks, assumptions and
  evidence, with deterministic review and human-acknowledged AI proposals.
authors:
